Package: coclustOrdinal
Type: Package
Title: Co-Clustering of Ordinal Data with a CUB Latent Block Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Eoin", "BRERETON HURLEY", email = "eoinwbh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Model-based co-clustering of ordinal data matrices. Rows and
    columns are simultaneously partitioned with a latent block model whose
    blocks follow a CUB (Combination of Uniform and shifted Binomial)
    distribution. Parameters are estimated with a SEM-Gibbs algorithm with
    multiple random initializations, and the ICL criterion is used to compare
    numbers of row and column clusters.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, mclust
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
